        "TileImage": "$($repository 856b2aa2-e224-48c3-b890-01fdf4dba6de).Image",
        "Description": "瓦尔顿天灾 The Walton Cataclysm\r关卡目标：\r*先前目标已全部更换\r*扮演警长，用事故消灭海伦·韦斯特\r*扮演邮递员，用事故消灭德维特·格拉默\r*扮演烧烤大王威尔逊，用爆炸事故消灭苏珊·威尔逊\r*不得有连带伤害，且无尸体被发现\rThe Targets:\r*Previous targets are all changed now\r*Eliminate Helen West in an accident when you disguise as sheriff Masterson\r*Eliminate Dewitt Grammer in an accident when you disguise as mailman\r*Eliminate Susan Wilson in an explosion accident when you disguise as Richard Wilson,the BBQ king\r*No collateral damage and bodies found",
